{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/andyoucreations/items/201636/", "pk": 201636, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/andyoucreations/", "pk": 37465, "shortname": "andyoucreations", "name": "And You Creations", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Ocean and You", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 9, "unicode": "Ocean and You", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.5, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.5, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 4250, "description": "#Ocean and You\n\n###Current Promotions:\nBirthday Drinks: Free Endless Beverages (Must Present ID)\n\n___________________\n\n###Weekly Events:\nMondays & Wednesdays:  BOGO 1/2 Off\nFridays: Fireworks (Regular Price)\n___________________\n\n###On Your Tour, You Will:\n- Party on an all-new 2020 powerboat with surround sound, mood lighting and wraparound seating\n- Keep your eyes out for wild spinner dolphin, whale and sea turtle sightings\n- Enjoy one free drink ticket per person.\n- Take in the beauty of Diamond Head and the Waikiki coastline\n- Experience fireworks over the ocean (Friday's Only)\n- Dance to a live DJ\n\n＊*Adult beverages will be available for purchase on the boat. $6 beer/seltzer/soft drinks and $12 liquor/cocktails*. One free drink ticket per person is included in the tour fee.*\n\n##Rates\n- Adults 21+: $79 (Fridays are $99)\n\n##Duration\n2 Hours\n\n##Location\nKewalo Basin Harbor Pier D Slip 111 (1125 Ala Moana Blvd)\n\n##Days of Operation & Departure Times\n\nFeatured Nights:\n- Mondays & Wednesdays (BUY ONE GET 50% OFF)\n- Fridays (Fireworks!!!)\n\nSummer Sunset Tours (April - September): \n\n- 5:45 PM Check- in\n- 6:15 PM Departure\n\nWinter Sunset Tours (October - March): \n\n- 5:00 PM Check- in\n- 5:30 PM Departure\n\nTake in the beauty of Diamond head and dance to a live DJ on an all-new luxury powerboat! Ocean and You is the premier Oahu experience for your party cruise.\n\nBoard the double-decker boat and explore its wraparound seating and Titanic-style front railing. Keep your eyes on the horizon for sightings of Hawaiian spinner dolphins, or humpback whales in winter. Then, dance and party to a live DJ.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Kewalo Basin Harbor Pier D: 1125 Ala Moana Blvd B1, Honolulu, HI 96814", "booking_notes": "#ALOHA,\nThank you for booking your **Ocean and You** tour with [And You Creations](https://andyoucreations.com/). \n\nPlease meet us at the Kewalo Basin Harbor 30 minutes before departure, located in the Kaka’ako District of Honolulu along Ala Moana Boulevard, between Ward Avenue and Ala Moana Park Drive.\nAddress: 1125 Ala Moana Blvd, Honolulu, HI 96814 (Pier D Gate #111)\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ECbwWcyQZmqPi0N5Elah)\n\n**If you are parking, limited parking is available in Kewalo Basin Park at *$2.50 per hour***. \n\nThe parking lot for members and visitors is located on the Diamond Head side of the harbor. Stalls in front of the charter boats are reserved for those members only.\n\nPlease read through this entire email for important general information regarding your tour. Don't hesitate to contact us if you have any questions or special requests.\n\nMahalo!\n\n_________________________\n\n\n#WHAT TO BRING:\n- Long-sleeve Jacket or Sweat Shirt\n- Motion Sickness Medicine (For those who are prone to getting seasick, we recommend taking medication an hour before the tour start time)\n- Adult beverages will be available for purchase on the boat. Hard liquor goes from $6 to $12. Soft drinks, Beer and Seltzers are $6.*One free drink ticket per person is included in the tour fee.*\n- Valid ID for 21+ \n\n**No outside alcoholic beverages allowed**\n\n**You will be asked to remove your shoes before boarding the boat. This is for your safety. We will have storage for you to place them in during your time onboard. Clean reef shoes and grip socks are permitted.**\n\n*Please limit your belongings to one bag per group due to limited space on the boat.\n\n*If you have a US number that we can reach out, please contact us. \n\n*Smoking, vaping, alcohol consumption, and the use or possession of illegal drugs are not permitted on our premises, including our buses and boats. Guests who do not comply with this policy may be denied service or removed from the premises at our discretion, without refund.\n\n _________________________\n\nGet ready for a memorable night off the coast of Waikiki!\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/xDaF9lF8RH6iKfw9tvUh)", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/QORrUpu4Sxeg9AqYj1VR)\n\nPlease arrive early for your visit as parking is limited. Additionally, if you plan on consuming alcohol, we recommend using Uber, a designated driver or a Taxi service for transportation.", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "20% Off! with Code Fall20 (Friday tours excluded) – Waikiki Booze Cruise with Live DJ!", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/andyoucreations/items/201636/images/1844524/", "pk": 1844524, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image